ch, Mount Everest, New Your and many other exciting places.\n\nYou can enter your own locations or use a small pre-selection available in the main menu of this app. \n\nApart from that, you can also check the current weather in the places you visit virtually. \n\nOver 400 cities can be displayed in 3D. Natural wonders like the Grand Canyon, the Dolomites or other mountain landscapes are all in 3D without exception.", "short_description": "high2earth allows you to travel virtually to many locations around the world: Rome, Seattle, Munich, Mount Everest, New Your and many other exciting places.\n\nYou can enter your own locations or use a small pre-selection available in the main menu of this app. \n\nApart from that, you can also check the current weather in the places you visit virtually. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://highlewelt.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "highlewelt GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.highlewelt.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27502547719344442"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031396_586929929413538_8338578501273499386_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_n